# Files that must never be uploaded to Vercel.
#
# Without this, Vercel finds package.json + app.js and treats the project as a
# Node server whose entrypoint is app.js — so "/" runs the browser script in a
# serverless function and the site is dead. Excluding package.json keeps the
# deployment purely static, with api/*.js picked up as functions.
package.json
package-lock.json
server.js
tools/
README.md
